window.L137={"phrases": [{"id": "instruction-1", "type": "instruction", "n": 1, "of": 4, "ref": null, "text": "🖊️Take your Blood of Jesus and go outside to a safe place in the garden.", "speak": "Take your Blood of Jesus and go outside to a safe place in the garden.", "speakRef": null, "action": false, "help": {"simple": "Pastor Kiki directs you to take your Blood of Jesus and go outside to a safe place in the garden. The Blood of Jesus you carry is a point of contact for your faith. The power is not in the drink; the power is in the blood Jesus shed.", "example": "Choose a safe spot outside where you can pray aloud. Take your phone so you can follow along.", "verse": {"ref": "Exodus 12:13 KJV", "text": "And the blood shall be to you for a token upon the houses where ye are: and when I see the blood, I will pass over you, and the plague shall not be upon you to destroy you, when I smite the land of Egypt."}, "key": "Blood of Jesus · Outside · Safe place"}}, {"id": "instruction-2", "type": "instruction", "n": 2, "of": 4, "ref": null, "text": "🖊️Read the scriptures provided above", "speak": "Read the scriptures provided above", "speakRef": null, "action": false, "help": {"simple": "Read the three Scriptures Pastor Kiki gave: Psalm 75:10, Psalm 3:3 and Revelation 12:11. When you read God's Word aloud, you also hear it, and faith comes by hearing.", "example": "Read each verse slowly in a normal speaking voice before you start the declarations.", "verse": {"ref": "Romans 10:17 KJV", "text": "So then faith cometh by hearing, and hearing by the word of God."}, "key": "Read · Scriptures", "teach": [{"q": "Because when you hear yourself read, faith comes, you see?", "by": "Derek Prince", "src": "The Provision Is in the Promises", "url": "https://www.derekprince.com/radio/c-r143-104"}]}}, {"id": "instruction-3", "type": "instruction", "n": 3, "of": 4, "ref": null, "text": "🖊️Pray the powerful warfare prayers provided below, commanding every evil horn raised against your life, family, destiny, finances, marriage, children, and ministry to be broken in the mighty Name of Jesus.", "speak": "Pray the powerful warfare prayers provided below, commanding every evil horn raised against your life, family, destiny, finances, marriage, children, and ministry to be broken in the mighty Name of Jesus.", "speakRef": null, "action": false, "help": {"simple": "Pastor Kiki directs you to pray the warfare prayers, commanding every evil horn raised against your life, family, destiny, finances, marriage, children and ministry to be broken in the Name of Jesus. In the Bible a horn is a picture of power. Strong's Concordance (H7161) gives the figurative meaning of the Hebrew word for horn as power.", "example": "Speak each declaration with authority, in the Name of Jesus.", "verse": {"ref": "Luke 10:19 KJV", "text": "Behold, I give unto you power to tread on serpents and scorpions, and over all the power of the enemy: and nothing shall by any means hurt you."}, "key": "Command · Evil horn · Name of Jesus", "teach": [{"q": "They are horns, denoting their dignity and dominion—horns exalted, denoting also their strength, and power, and violence.", "by": "Matthew Henry", "src": "Commentary on Zechariah 1", "url": "https://www.biblestudytools.com/commentaries/matthew-henry-complete/zechariah/1.html"}]}}, {"id": "instruction-4", "type": "instruction", "n": 4, "of": 4, "ref": null, "text": "🖊️When you have finished praying, pour The Blood of Jesus on the ground and thank the Lord for victory, deliverance, restoration, divine protection, and answered prayers in Jesus Name.", "speak": "When you have finished praying, pour The Blood of Jesus on the ground and thank the Lord for victory, deliverance, restoration, divine protection, and answered prayers in Jesus Name.", "speakRef": null, "action": false, "help": {"simple": "When you have finished praying, pour the Blood of Jesus on the ground and thank the Lord for victory, deliverance, restoration, divine protection and answered prayers.", "example": "After the last declaration, pour, then thank the Lord for each of the five things Pastor Kiki named.", "verse": {"ref": "Philippians 4:6 KJV", "text": "Be careful for nothing; but in every thing by prayer and supplication with thanksgiving let your requests be made known unto God."}, "key": "Pour · Thank the Lord", "teach": [{"q": "It’s our personal testimony that takes the blood out of the basin and applies it to our lives, to our situation, to our family, to where we live.", "by": "Derek Prince", "src": "How To Appropriate The Blood", "url": "https://www.derekprince.com/sermons/146"}]}}, {"id": "scripture-1", "type": "scripture", "n": 1, "of": 3, "ref": "Psalm 75:10 KJV", "text": "All the horns of the wicked also will I cut off; But the horns of the righteous shall be exalted.”", "speak": "All the horns of the wicked also will I cut off; But the horns of the righteous shall be exalted.", "speakRef": "Psalm 75 verse 10.", "action": false, "help": {"simple": "Psalm 75 is a song of Asaph. This verse says the horns, meaning the power, of the wicked will be cut off, but the horns of the righteous shall be exalted, lifted up.", "example": "Picture power being taken away from what fights you, and God lifting you up.", "verse": {"ref": "Psalm 75:6–7 KJV", "text": "For promotion cometh neither from the east, nor from the west, nor from the south. But God is the judge: he putteth down one, and setteth up another."}, "key": "Cut off · Exalted", "teach": [{"q": "They are horns, denoting their dignity and dominion—horns exalted, denoting also their strength, and power, and violence.", "by": "Matthew Henry", "src": "Commentary on Zechariah 1", "url": "https://www.biblestudytools.com/commentaries/matthew-henry-complete/zechariah/1.html"}]}}, {"id": "scripture-2", "type": "scripture", "n": 2, "of": 3, "ref": "Psalm 3:3 KJV", "text": "But thou, O LORD, art a shield for me; My glory, and the lifter up of mine head.”", "speak": "But thou, O LORD, art a shield for me; My glory, and the lifter up of mine head.", "speakRef": "Psalm 3 verse 3.", "action": false, "help": {"simple": "Psalm 3 is a psalm of David, written when he fled from his son Absalom. David calls the LORD his shield, his glory, and the lifter up of his head.", "example": "When you feel bowed down, say: The LORD is the lifter up of my head.", "verse": {"ref": "Psalm 27:6 KJV", "text": "And now shall mine head be lifted up above mine enemies round about me: therefore will I offer in his tabernacle sacrifices of joy; I will sing, yea, I will sing praises unto the LORD."}, "key": "Shield · Glory · Lifter up of mine head"}}, {"id": "scripture-3", "type": "scripture", "n": 3, "of": 3, "ref": "Revelation 12:11 KJV", "text": "“And they overcame him by the blood of the Lamb, and by the word of their testimony; and they loved not their lives unto the death.”", "speak": "And they overcame him by the blood of the Lamb, and by the word of their testimony; and they loved not their lives unto the death.", "speakRef": "Revelation chapter 12 verse 11.", "action": false, "help": {"simple": "Believers overcame the devil in two ways: by the blood of the Lamb, which is what Jesus did, and by the word of their testimony, which is speaking what God's Word says.", "example": "Say out loud what the Bible says the blood of Jesus has done for you.", "verse": {"ref": "Revelation 12:10 KJV", "text": "And I heard a loud voice saying in heaven, Now is come salvation, and strength, and the kingdom of our God, and the power of his Christ: for the accuser of our brethren is cast down, which accused them before our God day and night."}, "key": "Blood of the Lamb · Word of their testimony", "teach": [{"q": "We overcome Satan when we testify personally to what the Word says the blood does for us.", "by": "Derek Prince", "src": "How To Appropriate The Blood", "url": "https://www.derekprince.com/sermons/146"}, {"q": "Through the blood of Jesus I am redeemed out of the hand of the devil.", "by": "Derek Prince", "src": "Spiritual Weapons – The Blood, the Word, Our Testimony", "url": "https://www.derekprince.com/sermons/389"}]}}, {"id": "declaration-1", "type": "declaration", "n": 1, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌As I pour the blood of Jesus upon this earth, every evil horn fighting against my life, my destiny, and my progress, be broken and destroyed now in Jesus Name.", "speak": "As I pour the blood of Jesus upon this earth, every evil horn fighting against my life, my destiny, and my progress, be broken and destroyed now in Jesus Name.", "speakRef": null, "action": true, "help": {"simple": "As you pour, you speak against every evil horn fighting your life, your destiny and your progress. The pouring is a prophetic action; the power is in the blood of Jesus.", "example": "Pour slowly while you say the words.", "verse": {"ref": "Hebrews 12:24 KJV", "text": "And to Jesus the mediator of the new covenant, and to the blood of sprinkling, that speaketh better things than that of Abel."}, "key": "Pour · Broken · Destroyed", "teach": [{"q": "When I testify, then I make the blood available to my situation.", "by": "Derek Prince", "src": "Spiritual Weapons – The Blood, the Word, Our Testimony", "url": "https://www.derekprince.com/sermons/389"}]}}, {"id": "declaration-2", "type": "declaration", "n": 2, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌O earth, earth, earth, hear the Word of the Lord, Every horn of wickedness raised against my rising, my elevation, and my breakthrough, be shattered by the fire of the Holy Ghost.", "speak": "O earth, earth, earth, hear the Word of the Lord, Every horn of wickedness raised against my rising, my elevation, and my breakthrough, be shattered by the fire of the Holy Ghost.", "speakRef": null, "action": false, "help": {"simple": "“O earth, earth, earth, hear the word of the LORD” are the words of Jeremiah 22:29. Then you command every horn of wickedness against your rising, elevation and breakthrough to be shattered.", "example": "Say “O earth, earth, earth” clearly, then speak the rest with faith.", "verse": {"ref": "Jeremiah 22:29 KJV", "text": "O earth, earth, earth, hear the word of the LORD."}, "key": "Earth · Rising · Breakthrough"}}, {"id": "declaration-3", "type": "declaration", "n": 3, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌As I pour this blood of Jesus upon the ground, every evil horn that has scattered my blessings, my opportunities, my finances, and my divine helpers, be broken by the power of God in Jesus Name.", "speak": "As I pour this blood of Jesus upon the ground, every evil horn that has scattered my blessings, my opportunities, my finances, and my divine helpers, be broken by the power of God in Jesus Name.", "speakRef": null, "action": true, "help": {"simple": "In Zechariah’s vision the horns were the powers that scattered God’s people. Here you speak against every horn that has scattered your blessings, opportunities, finances and divine helpers.", "example": "Think of what has been scattered in your life as you pray.", "verse": {"ref": "Zechariah 1:19 KJV", "text": "And I said unto the angel that talked with me, What be these? And he answered me, These are the horns which have scattered Judah, Israel, and Jerusalem."}, "key": "Scattered · Divine helpers", "teach": [{"q": "If there be horns (which denote the force and fury of beasts) against the church, there are carpenters (which denote the wisdom and forecast of men) for the church.", "by": "Matthew Henry", "src": "Commentary on Zechariah 1", "url": "https://www.biblestudytools.com/commentaries/matthew-henry-complete/zechariah/1.html"}]}}, {"id": "declaration-4", "type": "declaration", "n": 4, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌Every horn of wickedness that has vowed that I will never lift my head, never prosper, never marry, and never fulfil my destiny, Break by fire.", "speak": "Every horn of wickedness that has vowed that I will never lift my head, never prosper, never marry, and never fulfil my destiny, Break by fire.", "speakRef": null, "action": false, "help": {"simple": "Zechariah 1:21 says the horns scattered Judah “so that no man did lift up his head.” This declaration breaks every horn that vowed you would never lift your head.", "example": "Lift your head as you say it.", "verse": {"ref": "Zechariah 1:21 KJV", "text": "Then said I, What come these to do? And he spake, saying, These are the horns which have scattered Judah, so that no man did lift up his head: but these are come to fray them, to cast out the horns of the Gentiles, which lifted up their horn over the land of Judah to scatter it."}, "key": "Lift my head · Destiny"}}, {"id": "declaration-5", "type": "declaration", "n": 5, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌As this blood touches the ground, I declare by faith that every horn of oppression fighting against my family, my children, and my household shall be brought down by the power of Jesus Christ.", "speak": "As this blood touches the ground, I declare by faith that every horn of oppression fighting against my family, my children, and my household shall be brought down by the power of Jesus Christ.", "speakRef": null, "action": true, "help": {"simple": "As the blood touches the ground, you declare by faith that every horn of oppression against your family, children and household shall be brought down by the power of Jesus Christ. In Exodus 12 the blood was a token upon the houses.", "example": "Name your household before God as you pray.", "verse": {"ref": "Exodus 12:13 KJV", "text": "And the blood shall be to you for a token upon the houses where ye are: and when I see the blood, I will pass over you, and the plague shall not be upon you to destroy you, when I smite the land of Egypt."}, "key": "Family · Children · Household"}}, {"id": "declaration-6", "type": "declaration", "n": 6, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌Every ancestral pattern of oppression, failure, rejection, and non-achievement operating against my progress, I renounce your influence! Be destroyed now.", "speak": "Every ancestral pattern of oppression, failure, rejection, and non-achievement operating against my progress, I renounce your influence! Be destroyed now.", "speakRef": null, "action": false, "help": {"simple": "To renounce means to say clearly, “I reject this, and I will not agree with it any longer.” You renounce every ancestral pattern of oppression, failure, rejection and non-achievement.", "example": "Name any pattern you have seen in your family line and refuse it in Jesus’ Name.", "verse": {"ref": "Galatians 3:13 KJV", "text": "Christ hath redeemed us from the curse of the law, being made a curse for us: for it is written, Cursed is every one that hangeth on a tree:"}, "key": "Ancestral · Renounce", "teach": [{"q": "There is a very simple practical exchange. Jesus became a curse that we might receive the blessing.", "by": "Derek Prince", "src": "Release from the Curse – Part 1", "url": "https://www.derekprince.com/sermons/326"}]}}, {"id": "declaration-7", "type": "declaration", "n": 7, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌O Lord, arise and cut off every horn of the wicked standing against my financial breakthrough, my career advancement, my business, and my divine establishment.", "speak": "O Lord, arise and cut off every horn of the wicked standing against my financial breakthrough, my career advancement, my business, and my divine establishment.", "speakRef": null, "action": false, "help": {"simple": "You ask the Lord to arise and cut off every horn of the wicked standing against your finances, career, business and divine establishment. Psalm 68:1 says, “Let God arise, let his enemies be scattered.”", "example": "Pray over your work and finances by name.", "verse": {"ref": "Psalm 68:1 KJV", "text": "Let God arise, let his enemies be scattered: let them also that hate him flee before him."}, "key": "Arise · Cut off · Finances"}}, {"id": "declaration-8", "type": "declaration", "n": 8, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌As I pour this blood of Jesus upon the earth, every evil horn standing at the gate of my next level, resisting my promotion and advancement, be uprooted by the fire of the Holy Ghost.", "speak": "As I pour this blood of Jesus upon the earth, every evil horn standing at the gate of my next level, resisting my promotion and advancement, be uprooted by the fire of the Holy Ghost.", "speakRef": null, "action": true, "help": {"simple": "Psalm 75:6–7 teaches that promotion comes from God, who “putteth down one, and setteth up another.” You speak against every horn at the gate of your next level.", "example": "Think of the next step God has for you as you pour.", "verse": {"ref": "Psalm 75:6–7 KJV", "text": "For promotion cometh neither from the east, nor from the west, nor from the south. But God is the judge: he putteth down one, and setteth up another."}, "key": "Gate · Next level · Promotion"}}, {"id": "declaration-9", "type": "declaration", "n": 9, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌Every horn of darkness that has kept my head bowed in shame, disgrace, humiliation, and disappointment, hear the Word of the Lord, Be shattered now, My God shall lift my head, in Jesus Name.", "speak": "Every horn of darkness that has kept my head bowed in shame, disgrace, humiliation, and disappointment, hear the Word of the Lord, Be shattered now, My God shall lift my head, in Jesus Name.", "speakRef": null, "action": false, "help": {"simple": "Every horn of darkness that kept your head bowed in shame, disgrace, humiliation and disappointment is commanded to be shattered. Then you declare: My God shall lift my head.", "example": "Say the last part, “My God shall lift my head,” with your head lifted.", "verse": {"ref": "Psalm 27:6 KJV", "text": "And now shall mine head be lifted up above mine enemies round about me: therefore will I offer in his tabernacle sacrifices of joy; I will sing, yea, I will sing praises unto the LORD."}, "key": "Head bowed · Lift my head"}}, {"id": "declaration-10", "type": "declaration", "n": 10, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌Every horn of household oppression seeking to scatter my marriage, divide my family, frustrate my children, and destroy my peace, be broken by the mighty hand of God.", "speak": "Every horn of household oppression seeking to scatter my marriage, divide my family, frustrate my children, and destroy my peace, be broken by the mighty hand of God.", "speakRef": null, "action": false, "help": {"simple": "You pray against every horn of household oppression seeking to scatter your marriage, divide your family, frustrate your children and destroy your peace.", "example": "Pray for your marriage and family by name.", "verse": {"ref": "Joshua 24:15 KJV", "text": "And if it seem evil unto you to serve the LORD, choose you this day whom ye will serve; whether the gods which your fathers served that were on the other side of the flood, or the gods of the Amorites, in whose land ye dwell: but as for me and my house, we will serve the LORD."}, "key": "Marriage · Family · Peace"}}, {"id": "declaration-11", "type": "declaration", "n": 11, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌As I pour this blood upon the ground, every evil horn speaking against my name, my reputation, my opportunities, and my future, be silenced by the authority of Jesus Christ.", "speak": "As I pour this blood upon the ground, every evil horn speaking against my name, my reputation, my opportunities, and my future, be silenced by the authority of Jesus Christ.", "speakRef": null, "action": true, "help": {"simple": "Every evil horn speaking against your name, reputation, opportunities and future is silenced by the authority of Jesus Christ. Isaiah 54:17 says every tongue that rises against you in judgment you shall condemn.", "example": "Pray this over your good name.", "verse": {"ref": "Isaiah 54:17 KJV", "text": "No weapon that is formed against thee shall prosper; and every tongue that shall rise against thee in judgment thou shalt condemn. This is the heritage of the servants of the LORD, and their righteousness is of me, saith the LORD."}, "key": "Name · Reputation · Silenced"}}, {"id": "declaration-12", "type": "declaration", "n": 12, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌Every horn of stagnation that has kept me in one position for years, resisting my progress and delaying my expectations, BREAK! BREAK! BREAK NOW", "speak": "Every horn of stagnation that has kept me in one position for years, resisting my progress and delaying my expectations, Break! Break! Break now!", "speakRef": null, "action": false, "help": {"simple": "Stagnation means being stuck in one place for a long time. Pastor Kiki commands every horn of stagnation to break, three times: BREAK! BREAK! BREAK NOW.", "example": "Say the three “BREAK” words with faith.", "verse": {"ref": "Deuteronomy 28:13 KJV", "text": "And the LORD shall make thee the head, and not the tail; and thou shalt be above only, and thou shalt not be beneath; if that thou hearken unto the commandments of the LORD thy God, which I command thee this day, to observe and to do them:"}, "key": "Stagnation · Break"}}, {"id": "declaration-13", "type": "declaration", "n": 13, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌O God who sent the four craftsmen to cast down the four horns, arise and send Your divine intervention against every opposition fighting my destiny", "speak": "O God who sent the four craftsmen to cast down the four horns, arise and send Your divine intervention against every opposition fighting my destiny", "speakRef": null, "action": false, "help": {"simple": "This is Zechariah 1:20–21: the LORD showed four carpenters, also called craftsmen, who came to fray and cast out the horns. You ask God to send His divine intervention against every opposition fighting your destiny.", "example": "Remember God has already prepared the answer to every horn.", "verse": {"ref": "Zechariah 1:20–21 KJV", "text": "And the LORD shewed me four carpenters. Then said I, What come these to do? And he spake, saying, These are the horns which have scattered Judah, so that no man did lift up his head: but these are come to fray them, to cast out the horns of the Gentiles, which lifted up their horn over the land of Judah to scatter it."}, "key": "Four craftsmen · Divine intervention", "teach": [{"q": "God calls those to serve the interests of his church whom he either finds, or makes, fit for it.", "by": "Matthew Henry", "src": "Commentary on Zechariah 1", "url": "https://www.biblestudytools.com/commentaries/matthew-henry-complete/zechariah/1.html"}]}}, {"id": "declaration-14", "type": "declaration", "n": 14, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌As I pour this blood of Jesus upon the earth, every horn of affliction, infirmity, sorrow, and oppression rising against my health and peace, be broken Now. Lord, release Your healing and restoration upon my life Now", "speak": "As I pour this blood of Jesus upon the earth, every horn of affliction, infirmity, sorrow, and oppression rising against my health and peace, be broken Now. Lord, release Your healing and restoration upon my life Now", "speakRef": null, "action": true, "help": {"simple": "You speak against every horn of affliction, infirmity, sorrow and oppression against your health and peace, and ask the Lord to release His healing and restoration.", "example": "Pray over your body and mind. Keep following your doctor’s care as well.", "verse": {"ref": "Jeremiah 30:17 KJV", "text": "For I will restore health unto thee, and I will heal thee of thy wounds, saith the LORD; because they called thee an Outcast, saying, This is Zion, whom no man seeketh after."}, "key": "Healing · Restoration"}}, {"id": "declaration-15", "type": "declaration", "n": 15, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌Every evil horn that rises whenever I am about to receive good news, a promotion, a breakthrough, or an answered prayer, lose your power over my life, in Jesus mighty Name.", "speak": "Every evil horn that rises whenever I am about to receive good news, a promotion, a breakthrough, or an answered prayer, lose your power over my life, in Jesus mighty Name.", "speakRef": null, "action": false, "help": {"simple": "Some opposition seems to rise just before good news. This declaration commands every such horn to lose its power over your life.", "example": "Pray this over what you are waiting for.", "verse": {"ref": "Luke 10:19 KJV", "text": "Behold, I give unto you power to tread on serpents and scorpions, and over all the power of the enemy: and nothing shall by any means hurt you."}, "key": "Good news · Lose your power"}}, {"id": "declaration-16", "type": "declaration", "n": 16, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌Every horn of wickedness fighting against my children and the generations coming after me, be broken by the power of the Holy Ghost, My children shall rise, prosper in God's purpose, and fulfil their divine assignments.", "speak": "Every horn of wickedness fighting against my children and the generations coming after me, be broken by the power of the Holy Ghost, My children shall rise, prosper in God's purpose, and fulfil their divine assignments.", "speakRef": null, "action": false, "help": {"simple": "You break every horn fighting your children and the generations after you, and declare that your children shall rise, prosper in God’s purpose and fulfil their divine assignments.", "example": "Say your children’s names quietly before you declare it.", "verse": {"ref": "Isaiah 49:25 KJV", "text": "But thus saith the LORD, Even the captives of the mighty shall be taken away, and the prey of the terrible shall be delivered: for I will contend with him that contendeth with thee, and I will save thy children."}, "key": "Children · Generations"}}, {"id": "declaration-17", "type": "declaration", "n": 17, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌As I pour this blood of Jesus upon the ground, I declare that every destructive pattern of repeated disappointment, failure, poverty, and rejection in my family shall come to an end, in Jesus Name", "speak": "As I pour this blood of Jesus upon the ground, I declare that every destructive pattern of repeated disappointment, failure, poverty, and rejection in my family shall come to an end, in Jesus Name", "speakRef": null, "action": true, "help": {"simple": "As you pour, you declare that every destructive pattern of repeated disappointment, failure, poverty and rejection in your family shall come to an end.", "example": "Say: It ends with me, in Jesus’ Name.", "verse": {"ref": "2 Corinthians 5:17 KJV", "text": "Therefore if any man be in Christ, he is a new creature: old things are passed away; behold, all things are become new."}, "key": "Pattern · Come to an end"}}, {"id": "declaration-18", "type": "declaration", "n": 18, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌Every evil horn that has scattered my joy, stolen my peace, weakened my prayer life, and brought discouragement into my heart, be cast down by the fire of the Holy Ghost, in Jesus mighty Name", "speak": "Every evil horn that has scattered my joy, stolen my peace, weakened my prayer life, and brought discouragement into my heart, be cast down by the fire of the Holy Ghost, in Jesus mighty Name", "speakRef": null, "action": false, "help": {"simple": "You cast down every evil horn that scattered your joy, stole your peace, weakened your prayer life and brought discouragement into your heart.", "example": "Pray for your prayer life to be strong again.", "verse": {"ref": "James 4:7 KJV", "text": "Submit yourselves therefore to God. Resist the devil, and he will flee from you."}, "key": "Joy · Peace · Prayer life"}}, {"id": "declaration-19", "type": "declaration", "n": 19, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌O Lord as you cut off the Horns of the wicked, exalt my Horn,  Lift my head above shame, rejection, delay, stagnation, and every opposition, Let my testimony manifest for Your glory, in Jesus Name", "speak": "O Lord as you cut off the Horns of the wicked, exalt my Horn, Lift my head above shame, rejection, delay, stagnation, and every opposition, Let my testimony manifest for Your glory, in Jesus Name", "speakRef": null, "action": false, "help": {"simple": "As the Lord cuts off the horns of the wicked, you ask Him to exalt your horn and lift your head above shame, rejection, delay, stagnation and every opposition. In 1 Samuel 2:1 Hannah prayed, “mine horn is exalted in the LORD.”", "example": "Pray that your testimony will show God’s glory.", "verse": {"ref": "1 Samuel 2:1 KJV", "text": "And Hannah prayed, and said, My heart rejoiceth in the LORD, mine horn is exalted in the LORD: my mouth is enlarged over mine enemies; because I rejoice in thy salvation."}, "key": "Exalt my horn · Testimony"}}, {"id": "declaration-20", "type": "declaration", "n": 20, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌AS I POUR THIS BLOOD OF JESUS UPON THE EARTH, I DECLARE BY THE AUTHORITY OF JESUS CHRIST, EVERY EVIL HORN FIGHTING MY LIFE, MY FAMILY, MY CHILDREN, MY MARRIAGE, MY FINANCES, MY MINISTRY, AND MY DESTINY, BE BROKEN NOW.", "speak": "AS I POUR THIS BLOOD OF JESUS UPON THE EARTH, I DECLARE BY THE AUTHORITY OF JESUS CHRIST, EVERY EVIL HORN FIGHTING MY LIFE, MY FAMILY, MY CHILDREN, MY MARRIAGE, MY FINANCES, MY MINISTRY, AND MY DESTINY, BE BROKEN NOW.", "speakRef": null, "action": true, "help": {"simple": "This is the summary declaration. By the authority of Jesus Christ you declare every evil horn fighting your life, family, children, marriage, finances, ministry and destiny broken now.", "example": "Say it loudly and with authority as you pour.", "verse": {"ref": "Colossians 2:15 KJV", "text": "And having spoiled principalities and powers, he made a shew of them openly, triumphing over them in it."}, "key": "Authority · Broken now", "teach": [{"q": "We overcome Satan when we testify personally to what the Word says the blood does for us.", "by": "Derek Prince", "src": "How To Appropriate The Blood", "url": "https://www.derekprince.com/sermons/146"}]}}, {"id": "declaration-21", "type": "declaration", "n": 21, "of": 21, "ref": null, "text": "📌LET MY HORN BE EXALTED ABOVE EVERY OPPOSITION, IN THE MIGHTY NAME OF JESUS CHRIST AMEN 🙏🏽", "speak": "LET MY HORN BE EXALTED ABOVE EVERY OPPOSITION, IN THE MIGHTY NAME OF JESUS CHRIST AMEN", "speakRef": null, "action": false, "help": {"simple": "The final declaration: Let my horn be exalted above every opposition, in the mighty Name of Jesus Christ. Amen.", "example": "Finish with a strong Amen.", "verse": {"ref": "Psalm 92:10 KJV", "text": "But my horn shalt thou exalt like the horn of an unicorn: I shall be anointed with fresh oil."}, "key": "Exalted · Amen"}}, {"id": "thanks-1", "type": "thanks", "n": 1, "of": 1, "label": "Closing direction", "ref": null, "text": "📌NOW POUR THE BLOOD OF JESUS ON THE EARTH AND THANK THE LORD.", "speak": "NOW POUR THE BLOOD OF JESUS ON THE EARTH AND THANK THE LORD.", "speakRef": null, "action": true, "help": {"simple": "Pastor Kiki's closing direction: now pour the Blood of Jesus on the earth and thank the Lord.", "example": "Thank the Lord out loud for victory, deliverance, restoration, divine protection and answered prayers.", "verse": {"ref": "Philippians 4:6 KJV", "text": "Be careful for nothing; but in every thing by prayer and supplication with thanksgiving let your requests be made known unto God."}, "key": "Pour · Thank the Lord"}}, {"id": "thanks-2", "type": "thanks", "n": 2, "of": 2, "label": "Blessing", "ref": null, "text": "GOD BLESS YOU AS YOU PRAY IN FAITH! 🙏🏾", "speak": "God bless you as you pray in faith.", "speakRef": null, "action": false, "help": {"simple": "Pastor Kiki's blessing over everyone who prays.", "example": "Receive the blessing and continue to pray in faith.", "verse": {"ref": "Hebrews 11:6 KJV", "text": "But without faith it is impossible to please him: for he that cometh to God must believe that he is, and that he is a rewarder of them that diligently seek him."}, "key": "Bless · Faith"}}], "blessings": [{"v": 1, "ref": "Psalm 75:10 KJV", "text": "All the horns of the wicked also will I cut off; but the horns of the righteous shall be exalted.", "help": {"simple": "Psalm 75 is a song of Asaph. This verse says the horns, meaning the power, of the wicked will be cut off, but the horns of the righteous shall be exalted, lifted up.", "example": "Picture power being taken away from what fights you, and God lifting you up.", "verse": {"ref": "Psalm 75:6–7 KJV", "text": "For promotion cometh neither from the east, nor from the west, nor from the south. But God is the judge: he putteth down one, and setteth up another."}, "key": "Cut off · Exalted", "teach": [{"q": "They are horns, denoting their dignity and dominion—horns exalted, denoting also their strength, and power, and violence.", "by": "Matthew Henry", "src": "Commentary on Zechariah 1", "url": "https://www.biblestudytools.com/commentaries/matthew-henry-complete/zechariah/1.html"}]}}, {"v": 2, "ref": "Psalm 3:3 KJV", "text": "But thou, O LORD, art a shield for me; my glory, and the lifter up of mine head.", "help": {"simple": "Psalm 3 is a psalm of David, written when he fled from his son Absalom. David calls the LORD his shield, his glory, and the lifter up of his head.", "example": "When you feel bowed down, say: The LORD is the lifter up of my head.", "verse": {"ref": "Psalm 27:6 KJV", "text": "And now shall mine head be lifted up above mine enemies round about me: therefore will I offer in his tabernacle sacrifices of joy; I will sing, yea, I will sing praises unto the LORD."}, "key": "Shield · Glory · Lifter up of mine head"}}, {"v": 3, "ref": "Revelation 12:11 KJV", "text": "And they overcame him by the blood of the Lamb, and by the word of their testimony; and they loved not their lives unto the death.", "help": {"simple": "Believers overcame the devil in two ways: by the blood of the Lamb, which is what Jesus did, and by the word of their testimony, which is speaking what God's Word says.", "example": "Say out loud what the Bible says the blood of Jesus has done for you.", "verse": {"ref": "Revelation 12:10 KJV", "text": "And I heard a loud voice saying in heaven, Now is come salvation, and strength, and the kingdom of our God, and the power of his Christ: for the accuser of our brethren is cast down, which accused them before our God day and night."}, "key": "Blood of the Lamb · Word of their testimony", "teach": [{"q": "We overcome Satan when we testify personally to what the Word says the blood does for us.", "by": "Derek Prince", "src": "How To Appropriate The Blood", "url": "https://www.derekprince.com/sermons/146"}, {"q": "Through the blood of Jesus I am redeemed out of the hand of the devil.", "by": "Derek Prince", "src": "Spiritual Weapons – The Blood, the Word, Our Testimony", "url": "https://www.derekprince.com/sermons/389"}]}}], "review": {"flash": [{"q": "Psalm 75:10 — can you say it?", "a": "All the horns of the wicked also will I cut off; but the horns of the righteous shall be exalted. (Psalm 75:10 KJV)"}, {"q": "Psalm 3:3 — can you say it?", "a": "But thou, O LORD, art a shield for me; my glory, and the lifter up of mine head. (Psalm 3:3 KJV)"}, {"q": "Revelation 12:11 — can you say it?", "a": "And they overcame him by the blood of the Lamb, and by the word of their testimony; and they loved not their lives unto the death. (Revelation 12:11 KJV)"}, {"q": "Zechariah 1:18–21 — can you say it?", "a": "Then lifted I up mine eyes, and saw, and behold four horns. And I said unto the angel that talked with me, What be these? And he answered me, These are the horns which have scattered Judah, Israel, and Jerusalem. And the LORD shewed me four carpenters. Then said I, What come these to do? And he spake, saying, These are the horns which have scattered Judah, so that no man did lift up his head: but these are come to fray them, to cast out the horns of the Gentiles, which lifted up their horn over the land of Judah to scatter it. (Zechariah 1:18–21 KJV)"}], "quiz": [{"type": "mc", "q": "What is the first prophetic instruction?", "o": ["Read the Scriptures", "Take your Blood of Jesus and go outside to a safe place in the garden", "Pour the Blood of Jesus on the ground", "Thank the Lord"], "a": 1, "e": "Instruction 1: “Take your Blood of Jesus and go outside to a safe place in the garden.”"}, {"type": "tf", "q": "True or false: You pour the Blood of Jesus on the ground before you pray the declarations.", "a": false, "e": "False. Instruction 4: “When you have finished praying, pour The Blood of Jesus on the ground and thank the Lord…” Several declarations are also prayed as you pour."}, {"type": "mc", "q": "Which Scripture says “the lifter up of mine head”?", "o": ["Psalm 75:10", "Psalm 3:3", "Revelation 12:11"], "a": 1, "e": "Psalm 3:3 KJV: “But thou, O LORD, art a shield for me; my glory, and the lifter up of mine head.”"}, {"type": "mc", "q": "How many declarations are in Pastor Kiki’s October 14 direction?", "o": ["7", "21", "29"], "a": 1, "e": "There are 21 declarations."}, {"type": "mc", "q": "Declaration 13 speaks of God sending whom to cast down the four horns?", "o": ["Four angels", "Four craftsmen", "Four kings"], "a": 1, "e": "“O God who sent the four craftsmen to cast down the four horns…” See Zechariah 1:20–21, where the KJV says “four carpenters.”"}, {"type": "order", "q": "Put Pastor Kiki’s four instructions in order.", "items": ["Take your Blood of Jesus and go outside", "Read the scriptures", "Pray the warfare prayers", "Pour the Blood of Jesus on the ground and thank the Lord"], "e": "Go outside, read the Scriptures, pray the declarations, then pour and give thanks."}]}, "K": {"zech18": {"ref": "Zechariah 1:18 KJV", "text": "Then lifted I up mine eyes, and saw, and behold four horns."}, "zech116": {"ref": "Zechariah 1:16 KJV", "text": "Therefore thus saith the LORD; I am returned to Jerusalem with mercies: my house shall be built in it, saith the LORD of hosts, and a line shall be stretched forth upon Jerusalem."}, "ps182": {"ref": "Psalm 18:2 KJV", "text": "The LORD is my rock, and my fortress, and my deliverer; my God, my strength, in whom I will trust; my buckler, and the horn of my salvation, and my high tower."}, "ps14814": {"ref": "Psalm 148:14 KJV", "text": "He also exalteth the horn of his people, the praise of all his saints; even of the children of Israel, a people near unto him. Praise ye the LORD."}, "luke169": {"ref": "Luke 1:69 KJV", "text": "And hath raised up an horn of salvation for us in the house of his servant David;"}, "ex1213": {"ref": "Exodus 12:13 KJV", "text": "And the blood shall be to you for a token upon the houses where ye are: and when I see the blood, I will pass over you, and the plague shall not be upon you to destroy you, when I smite the land of Egypt."}, "rom1017": {"ref": "Romans 10:17 KJV", "text": "So then faith cometh by hearing, and hearing by the word of God."}, "luke1019": {"ref": "Luke 10:19 KJV", "text": "Behold, I give unto you power to tread on serpents and scorpions, and over all the power of the enemy: and nothing shall by any means hurt you."}, "phil46": {"ref": "Philippians 4:6 KJV", "text": "Be careful for nothing; but in every thing by prayer and supplication with thanksgiving let your requests be made known unto God."}, "ps7567": {"ref": "Psalm 75:6–7 KJV", "text": "For promotion cometh neither from the east, nor from the west, nor from the south. But God is the judge: he putteth down one, and setteth up another."}, "ps276": {"ref": "Psalm 27:6 KJV", "text": "And now shall mine head be lifted up above mine enemies round about me: therefore will I offer in his tabernacle sacrifices of joy; I will sing, yea, I will sing praises unto the LORD."}, "rev1210": {"ref": "Revelation 12:10 KJV", "text": "And I heard a loud voice saying in heaven, Now is come salvation, and strength, and the kingdom of our God, and the power of his Christ: for the accuser of our brethren is cast down, which accused them before our God day and night."}, "heb1224": {"ref": "Hebrews 12:24 KJV", "text": "And to Jesus the mediator of the new covenant, and to the blood of sprinkling, that speaketh better things than that of Abel."}, "jer2229": {"ref": "Jeremiah 22:29 KJV", "text": "O earth, earth, earth, hear the word of the LORD."}, "zech119": {"ref": "Zechariah 1:19 KJV", "text": "And I said unto the angel that talked with me, What be these? And he answered me, These are the horns which have scattered Judah, Israel, and Jerusalem."}, "zech121": {"ref": "Zechariah 1:21 KJV", "text": "Then said I, What come these to do? And he spake, saying, These are the horns which have scattered Judah, so that no man did lift up his head: but these are come to fray them, to cast out the horns of the Gentiles, which lifted up their horn over the land of Judah to scatter it."}, "zech12021": {"ref": "Zechariah 1:20–21 KJV", "text": "And the LORD shewed me four carpenters. Then said I, What come these to do? And he spake, saying, These are the horns which have scattered Judah, so that no man did lift up his head: but these are come to fray them, to cast out the horns of the Gentiles, which lifted up their horn over the land of Judah to scatter it."}, "gal313": {"ref": "Galatians 3:13 KJV", "text": "Christ hath redeemed us from the curse of the law, being made a curse for us: for it is written, Cursed is every one that hangeth on a tree:"}, "ps681": {"ref": "Psalm 68:1 KJV", "text": "Let God arise, let his enemies be scattered: let them also that hate him flee before him."}, "josh2415": {"ref": "Joshua 24:15 KJV", "text": "And if it seem evil unto you to serve the LORD, choose you this day whom ye will serve; whether the gods which your fathers served that were on the other side of the flood, or the gods of the Amorites, in whose land ye dwell: but as for me and my house, we will serve the LORD."}, "isa5417": {"ref": "Isaiah 54:17 KJV", "text": "No weapon that is formed against thee shall prosper; and every tongue that shall rise against thee in judgment thou shalt condemn. This is the heritage of the servants of the LORD, and their righteousness is of me, saith the LORD."}, "deut2813": {"ref": "Deuteronomy 28:13 KJV", "text": "And the LORD shall make thee the head, and not the tail; and thou shalt be above only, and thou shalt not be beneath; if that thou hearken unto the commandments of the LORD thy God, which I command thee this day, to observe and to do them:"}, "jer3017": {"ref": "Jeremiah 30:17 KJV", "text": "For I will restore health unto thee, and I will heal thee of thy wounds, saith the LORD; because they called thee an Outcast, saying, This is Zion, whom no man seeketh after."}, "isa4925": {"ref": "Isaiah 49:25 KJV", "text": "But thus saith the LORD, Even the captives of the mighty shall be taken away, and the prey of the terrible shall be delivered: for I will contend with him that contendeth with thee, and I will save thy children."}, "cor517": {"ref": "2 Corinthians 5:17 KJV", "text": "Therefore if any man be in Christ, he is a new creature: old things are passed away; behold, all things are become new."}, "jas47": {"ref": "James 4:7 KJV", "text": "Submit yourselves therefore to God. Resist the devil, and he will flee from you."}, "sam21": {"ref": "1 Samuel 2:1 KJV", "text": "And Hannah prayed, and said, My heart rejoiceth in the LORD, mine horn is exalted in the LORD: my mouth is enlarged over mine enemies; because I rejoice in thy salvation."}, "col215": {"ref": "Colossians 2:15 KJV", "text": "And having spoiled principalities and powers, he made a shew of them openly, triumphing over them in it."}, "ps9210": {"ref": "Psalm 92:10 KJV", "text": "But my horn shalt thou exalt like the horn of an unicorn: I shall be anointed with fresh oil."}, "heb116": {"ref": "Hebrews 11:6 KJV", "text": "But without faith it is impossible to please him: for he that cometh to God must believe that he is, and that he is a rewarder of them that diligently seek him."}, "ps33": {"ref": "Psalm 3:3 KJV", "text": "But thou, O LORD, art a shield for me; my glory, and the lifter up of mine head."}, "ps7510": {"ref": "Psalm 75:10 KJV", "text": "All the horns of the wicked also will I cut off; but the horns of the righteous shall be exalted."}, "rev1211": {"ref": "Revelation 12:11 KJV", "text": "And they overcame him by the blood of the Lamb, and by the word of their testimony; and they loved not their lives unto the death."}, "zech11821": {"ref": "Zechariah 1:18–21 KJV", "text": "Then lifted I up mine eyes, and saw, and behold four horns. And I said unto the angel that talked with me, What be these? And he answered me, These are the horns which have scattered Judah, Israel, and Jerusalem. And the LORD shewed me four carpenters. Then said I, What come these to do? And he spake, saying, These are the horns which have scattered Judah, so that no man did lift up his head: but these are come to fray them, to cast out the horns of the Gentiles, which lifted up their horn over the land of Judah to scatter it."}}, "T": {"dp146": {"q": "We overcome Satan when we testify personally to what the Word says the blood does for us.", "by": "Derek Prince", "src": "How To Appropriate The Blood", "url": "https://www.derekprince.com/sermons/146"}, "dp146b": {"q": "It’s our personal testimony that takes the blood out of the basin and applies it to our lives, to our situation, to our family, to where we live.", "by": "Derek Prince", "src": "How To Appropriate The Blood", "url": "https://www.derekprince.com/sermons/146"}, "dp389": {"q": "When I testify, then I make the blood available to my situation.", "by": "Derek Prince", "src": "Spiritual Weapons – The Blood, the Word, Our Testimony", "url": "https://www.derekprince.com/sermons/389"}, "dp389b": {"q": "Through the blood of Jesus I am redeemed out of the hand of the devil.", "by": "Derek Prince", "src": "Spiritual Weapons – The Blood, the Word, Our Testimony", "url": "https://www.derekprince.com/sermons/389"}, "dphear": {"q": "Because when you hear yourself read, faith comes, you see?", "by": "Derek Prince", "src": "The Provision Is in the Promises", "url": "https://www.derekprince.com/radio/c-r143-104"}, "dpexch": {"q": "There is a very simple practical exchange. Jesus became a curse that we might receive the blessing.", "by": "Derek Prince", "src": "Release from the Curse – Part 1", "url": "https://www.derekprince.com/sermons/326"}, "mhhorns": {"q": "They are horns, denoting their dignity and dominion—horns exalted, denoting also their strength, and power, and violence.", "by": "Matthew Henry", "src": "Commentary on Zechariah 1", "url": "https://www.biblestudytools.com/commentaries/matthew-henry-complete/zechariah/1.html"}, "mhcarp": {"q": "If there be horns (which denote the force and fury of beasts) against the church, there are carpenters (which denote the wisdom and forecast of men) for the church.", "by": "Matthew Henry", "src": "Commentary on Zechariah 1", "url": "https://www.biblestudytools.com/commentaries/matthew-henry-complete/zechariah/1.html"}, "mhfit": {"q": "God calls those to serve the interests of his church whom he either finds, or makes, fit for it.", "by": "Matthew Henry", "src": "Commentary on Zechariah 1", "url": "https://www.biblestudytools.com/commentaries/matthew-henry-complete/zechariah/1.html"}, "gill": {"q": "and signify kingdoms or kings, and these very powerful and mighty;", "by": "John Gill", "src": "Exposition of the Bible, Zechariah 1:18", "url": "https://www.biblestudytools.com/commentaries/gills-exposition-of-the-bible/zechariah-1-18.html"}}, "header": ["October 14, 2026", "🛑*PROPHETIC DIRECTION*", "*DEALING WITH THE EVIL HORNS*", "*FASTING AND PRAYER*"], "say": "*SAY*", "direction": "October 14, 2026\n\n🛑*PROPHETIC DIRECTION*\n\n*DEALING WITH THE EVIL HORNS*\n\n*FASTING AND PRAYER* \n\nAll the horns of the wicked also will I cut off; But the horns of the righteous shall be exalted.”\nPsalm 75:10 KJV\n\nBut thou, O LORD, art a shield for me; My glory, and the lifter up of mine head.”\nPsalm 3:3 KJV\n\n“And they overcame him by the blood of the Lamb, and by the word of their testimony; and they loved not their lives unto the death.”\nRevelation 12:11 KJV\n\n\n🖊️Take your Blood of Jesus and go outside to a safe place in the garden.\n\n🖊️Read the scriptures provided above\n\n🖊️Pray the powerful warfare prayers provided below, commanding every evil horn raised against your life, family, destiny, finances, marriage, children, and ministry to be broken in the mighty Name of Jesus.\n\n🖊️When you have finished praying, pour The Blood of Jesus on the ground and thank the Lord for victory, deliverance, restoration, divine protection, and answered prayers in Jesus Name.\n\n*SAY* \n\n📌As I pour the blood of Jesus upon this earth, every evil horn fighting against my life, my destiny, and my progress, be broken and destroyed now in Jesus Name.\n\n📌O earth, earth, earth, hear the Word of the Lord, Every horn of wickedness raised against my rising, my elevation, and my breakthrough, be shattered by the fire of the Holy Ghost.\n\n📌As I pour this blood of Jesus upon the ground, every evil horn that has scattered my blessings, my opportunities, my finances, and my divine helpers, be broken by the power of God in Jesus Name.\n\n📌Every horn of wickedness that has vowed that I will never lift my head, never prosper, never marry, and never fulfil my destiny, Break by fire.\n\n📌As this blood touches the ground, I declare by faith that every horn of oppression fighting against my family, my children, and my household shall be brought down by the power of Jesus Christ.\n\n📌Every ancestral pattern of oppression, failure, rejection, and non-achievement operating against my progress, I renounce your influence! Be destroyed now.\n\n📌O Lord, arise and cut off every horn of the wicked standing against my financial breakthrough, my career advancement, my business, and my divine establishment.\n\n📌As I pour this blood of Jesus upon the earth, every evil horn standing at the gate of my next level, resisting my promotion and advancement, be uprooted by the fire of the Holy Ghost.\n\n📌Every horn of darkness that has kept my head bowed in shame, disgrace, humiliation, and disappointment, hear the Word of the Lord, Be shattered now, My God shall lift my head, in Jesus Name.\n\n📌Every horn of household oppression seeking to scatter my marriage, divide my family, frustrate my children, and destroy my peace, be broken by the mighty hand of God.\n\n📌As I pour this blood upon the ground, every evil horn speaking against my name, my reputation, my opportunities, and my future, be silenced by the authority of Jesus Christ.\n\n📌Every horn of stagnation that has kept me in one position for years, resisting my progress and delaying my expectations, BREAK! BREAK! BREAK NOW \n\n📌O God who sent the four craftsmen to cast down the four horns, arise and send Your divine intervention against every opposition fighting my destiny\n\n📌As I pour this blood of Jesus upon the earth, every horn of affliction, infirmity, sorrow, and oppression rising against my health and peace, be broken Now. Lord, release Your healing and restoration upon my life Now \n\n📌Every evil horn that rises whenever I am about to receive good news, a promotion, a breakthrough, or an answered prayer, lose your power over my life, in Jesus mighty Name.\n\n 📌Every horn of wickedness fighting against my children and the generations coming after me, be broken by the power of the Holy Ghost, My children shall rise, prosper in God's purpose, and fulfil their divine assignments.\n\n📌As I pour this blood of Jesus upon the ground, I declare that every destructive pattern of repeated disappointment, failure, poverty, and rejection in my family shall come to an end, in Jesus Name\n\n📌Every evil horn that has scattered my joy, stolen my peace, weakened my prayer life, and brought discouragement into my heart, be cast down by the fire of the Holy Ghost, in Jesus mighty Name \n\n📌O Lord as you cut off the Horns of the wicked, exalt my Horn,  Lift my head above shame, rejection, delay, stagnation, and every opposition, Let my testimony manifest for Your glory, in Jesus Name\n\n📌AS I POUR THIS BLOOD OF JESUS UPON THE EARTH, I DECLARE BY THE AUTHORITY OF JESUS CHRIST, EVERY EVIL HORN FIGHTING MY LIFE, MY FAMILY, MY CHILDREN, MY MARRIAGE, MY FINANCES, MY MINISTRY, AND MY DESTINY, BE BROKEN NOW.\n\n📌LET MY HORN BE EXALTED ABOVE EVERY OPPOSITION, IN THE MIGHTY NAME OF JESUS CHRIST AMEN 🙏🏽 \n\n📌NOW POUR THE BLOOD OF JESUS ON THE EARTH AND THANK THE LORD.\n\nGOD BLESS YOU AS YOU PRAY IN FAITH! 🙏🏾"};